The forests of Johto have long nurtured Trainers who value patience, harmony, and steady growth above raw power.


Once each year, those Trainers gather beneath open skies to determine who will earn the title of [div=display: inline; color:#8bc34a; font-weight: bold; font-variant: small-caps;]Grass-Type Master[/div].


Only a single Grass-type Pokémon may be entered, placing every battle on equal footing and ensuring that victory belongs not to the largest team, but to the strongest partnership.


Whether you're chasing glory, testing a lifelong companion, or simply looking to enjoy a day among fellow Trainers, the field is open.

